MODES
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  i                   Insert mode
  Esc                 Normal mode
  v                   Visual mode
  V                   Visual line mode
  Ctrl + V            Visual block mode
  :                   Command mode
  /                   Search forward
  ?                   Search backward


BASIC
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  u                   Undo
  Ctrl + R            Redo

  yy                  Yank / copy line
  dd                  Delete line
  D                   Delete to end of line
  x                   Delete character
  p                   Paste after cursor
  P                   Paste before cursor

  >>                  Indent line
  <<                  Unindent line
  J                   Join line below

  .                   Repeat last action


MOVEMENT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  h                   Move left
  j                   Move down
  k                   Move up
  l                   Move right

  w                   Next word
  b                   Previous word
  e                   End of word

  0                   Start of line
  ^                   First non-blank character
  $                   End of line

  gg                  Top of file
  G                   Bottom of file

  Ctrl + D            Half-page down
  Ctrl + U            Half-page up
  Ctrl + F            Full-page down
  Ctrl + B            Full-page up

  %                   Jump between brackets


SEARCH
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  /text               Search forward
  ?text               Search backward

  n                   Next search result
  N                   Previous search result

  *                   Search word under cursor
  #                   Search word under cursor backward

  :noh                Clear search highlighting


TEXT SELECTION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  v                   Character selection
  V                   Line selection
  Ctrl + V            Block selection

  iw                  Inner word
  aw                  Around word
  i"                  Inside quotes
  a"                  Around quotes
  i(                  Inside parentheses
  a(                  Around parentheses

  ciw                 Change inner word
  diw                 Delete inner word
  yiw                 Yank inner word


CHANGE / EDIT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  i                   Insert before cursor
  a                   Insert after cursor
  I                   Insert at start of line
  A                   Insert at end of line
  o                   New line below
  O                   New line above

  r                   Replace character
  R                   Replace mode
  c                   Change
  C                   Change to end of line
  S                   Change entire line

  cc                  Change entire line


WINDOWS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :split              Horizontal split
  :vsplit             Vertical split

  Ctrl + W + h        Move to left window
  Ctrl + W + j        Move to window below
  Ctrl + W + k        Move to window above
  Ctrl + W + l        Move to right window

  Ctrl + W + q        Close window
  Ctrl + W + o        Keep only current window

  Ctrl + W + =        Equalize window sizes
  Ctrl + W + +        Increase window height
  Ctrl + W + -        Decrease window height
  Ctrl + W + >        Increase window width
  Ctrl + W + <        Decrease window width


BUFFERS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :e file             Open file
  :enew               New buffer
  :bnext              Next buffer
  :bprev              Previous buffer
  :bdelete            Close buffer
  :buffers             List buffers

  :b N                Switch to buffer N


TABS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :tabnew             New tab
  :tabclose           Close tab
  :tabnext             Next tab
  :tabprev             Previous tab

  gt                  Next tab
  gT                  Previous tab


FILES
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :e file             Open file
  :w                  Save file
  :wa                 Save all files

  :q                  Quit
  :q!                 Quit without saving
  :wq                 Save and quit
  :x                  Save and quit

  ZZ                  Save and quit
  ZQ                  Quit without saving


REPLACE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :%s/old/new/g       Replace all occurrences in file
  :s/old/new/g        Replace occurrences on current line

  :%s/old/new/gc      Replace with confirmation

  &                   Repeat last substitution


VISUAL MODE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  y                   Yank selection
  d                   Delete selection
  c                   Change selection
  >                   Indent selection
  <                   Unindent selection
  J                   Join selected lines


COMMAND MODE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :w                  Write / save
  :q                  Quit
  :qa                 Quit all
  :wqa                Save and quit all
  :qa!                Quit all without saving

  :set number         Show line numbers
  :set relativenumber  Show relative line numbers
  :set nonumber       Hide line numbers

  :help topic         Open help


MACROS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  qq                  Record macro into register q
  q                   Stop recording
  @q                  Play macro q
  @@                  Repeat last macro


MARKS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ma                  Set mark "a"
  `a                  Jump to mark "a"
  ''                  Jump to previous location

  :marks              List marks


REGISTERS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :reg                Show registers

  "ayy                Yank line into register a
  "ap                 Paste from register a

  "+y                 Yank to system clipboard
  "+p                 Paste from system clipboard


FILE NAVIGATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :pwd                Show current directory
  :cd path            Change directory
  :Ex                 Open file explorer

  gf                  Open file under cursor
  Ctrl + ^            Switch to previous file


HELP
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  :help               Open Neovim help
  :help command       Help for command
  :help key           Help for key
  :help <C-w>         Help for key combination

  :q                  Close help


QUICK REMINDERS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Esc                 Get back to Normal mode
  :w                  Save
  :q                  Quit
  :wq                 Save + quit
  u                   Undo
  Ctrl + R            Redo
  dd                  Delete line
  yy                  Copy line
  p                   Paste
  /text               Search
  n                   Next result
  gg                  Top
  G                   Bottom
  .                   Repeat
